WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.150
Good morning Hank, it's Tuesday.

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:04.900
So we need to talk about your last Vlogbrothers
video, and not the one where the Gregory Brothers

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.889
songified our fight about Batman, the one
before that where you talked about...

00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:12.530
I actually don't remember what you talked
about because I was too focused on this.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:17.120
So Hank, Nerdfighter reviews of your new hair
cut were universally positive, but then again,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.100
Nerdfighteria is a very supportive and loving
community, whereas I am your brother.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.780
Hank, in my my life I've had three major hair
styles.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:28.260
For about the past fifteen years I've had
some variation of short on the sides, messy

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.260
up top.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.501
Before that, for many years I had a hair cut
called "The Junior Senator from Maryland"

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:36.150
and then of course there was my original hair
cut "Toad from Mario Kart."

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.840
Meanwhile Hank, your entire life you've had
just the one hair style, which I call The

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.920
Hank, I can't even describe the exact properties
of The Hank to you because it just is.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:47.920
It's like trying to describe water to a fish.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.090
"The Hank" is that which sits atop Hank's
head.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.180
And then suddenly, change!

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.820
Unannounced, radical change!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.000
Now Hank as you know, I'm not a huge fan of
change.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.220
I just think change is tremendously overrated.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:02.239
People are always like: "Life is change!"

00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:04.070
And that's true, but you know what else is
change?

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:05.070
Death.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:09.550
But Hank, your hairstyle change upset me particularly
because it reminded me a little bit of Kennedy's

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.550
haircut.

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:13.800
You know, the left-back of the AFC Wimbledon
Wimbly Womblys, the fictional soccer team

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.880
I play FIFA 14 with.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:18.370
Now Hank I realize when it comes to hair I
live in the glassiest of glass houses, but

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:21.600
I've been throwing rocks at Kennedy's hair
for years now.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.770
And then, suddenly, my own brother adopts
a version of The Kennedy.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.060
Well Hank, this led to a bit of an existential
crisis.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.310
Now Hank, admittedly, these days it doesn't
take much to point me in the direction of

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:34.720
an existential crisis, but I started thinking
about my brother, who is a real person in

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:40.610
real life I really like, and then there's
Kennedy, a very talented, but fictional, left-back

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:42.380
who's technically made out of pixels.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.159
But now in my head they're connected, so anything
I say about Kennedy's hair I'm sort of implying

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:47.380
about your hair.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.400
And the whole thing just made me think about
how nothing that happened in one's so called

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:55.159
"virtual life" could ever be fully disconnected
from what happens in your so called "real

00:01:55.159 --> 00:01:56.159
life", right?

00:01:56.159 --> 00:02:00.020
I think realness might be more of like a continuum
than an actual thing, you know?

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:04.270
Like ultimately, self-hood and relationships
and experiences and FIFA playing and whatever

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:08.860
else are varying degrees of real rather than
simply real or not.

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:10.930
Like Hank, in my life there are two AFC Wimbledons,
right?

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.260
There are the AFC Wimbledon Wimbly Womblys
a fictional FIFA team who have worked their

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:18.060
way up from League Two and are now enjoying
their first season in the Premier League,

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:22.970
and it's going great because Bald John Green
and Other John Green, our two strikers, have

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.260
found renewed form since the adoption of their
baby boy JJ.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:31.370
And that whole Wimbly Wombly world is to quote
Severus Snape "Real for Us", us being the

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.230
weird and lovely people who support the Wimbly
Womblys.

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:37.370
And then we use the ad revenue from that series
to sponsor the other AFC Wimbledon, you know,

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:38.610
the real one.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:42.760
That AFC Wimbledon is an actual professional
Soccer team in England, but it started 13

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:48.260
years ago from nothing except a bunch of fans
who had the idea to make a soccer team.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:53.640
The fact that imagination and work can make
ideas real is what finally resolved this existential

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:57.790
crisis, because it's like the most beautiful
and lovely thing about life to me.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.910
The whole thing just made me want to support
AFC Wimbledon more if we can, so I'm gonna

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.670
try to do more video gaming stuff.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.940
I've, started a Twitch TV channel, and even
though I don't really know how it works I'm

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.040
gonna try broadcasting today.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.040
There's a link in the doobly-doo.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:12.190
So basically Hank, your new haircut made me
think about what's real and what's not real

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:15.780
and how much I admire people like you and
the founders of AFC Wimbledon for working

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:18.160
so hard to make awesome things real.

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.200
And then I was like, you know what?

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.599
I kind of like Hank's new haircut, which,
by extension means that I guess now I kinda

00:03:23.599 --> 00:03:25.349
like Kennedy's haircut in FIFA.

00:03:25.349 --> 00:03:26.959
This was a very weird Vlogbrothers video.

00:03:26.959 --> 00:03:27.980
I will see you on Friday.

